- Ensure vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha (done).
- Ensure candidate_vehicle_linked origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha (done via allocate).
- Ensure operator_available driver_operator_alpha (after releasing).

